# 12. ENVIRONMENT & BUILD
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

## Environment Variables
```
# .env.example (commit this, not .env)
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.yourapp.com
EXPO_PUBLIC_AI_PROXY_URL=https://ai.yourapp.com/proxy
# Never prefix AI provider keys with EXPO_PUBLIC_ — keep them server-side only
```

## Build Variants
- `development` — verbose logging, mock AI responses available, debug menu
- `staging` — production API, real AI calls, Sentry staging project
- `production` — no logging of user data, no debug tooling

## OTA Updates
- Use Expo Updates for JS-only fixes.
- Never ship a breaking native change as an OTA update.
- AI prompt updates can ship via OTA — document the prompt version in update notes.

